#: templates/_macros/legal_disclaimer.html:12
msgid ""
"We do not condone piracy. RetroDB does not distribute or host ROM files. "
"Only use games you own, copied from your own discs and cartridges; the "
"law on making such copies differs from country to country, so check "
"yours. Game names, cover art, screenshots and videos belong to their "
"owners. RetroDB is not affiliated with or endorsed by any console maker, "
"game publisher, or the game databases and services it works with."
msgstr ""
"Kami tidak mendukung pembajakan. RetroDB tidak mendistribusikan atau "
"menghosting file ROM. Gunakan hanya game yang Anda miliki, yang disalin "
"dari disk dan kartrid Anda sendiri; hukum tentang pembuatan salinan "
"semacam itu berbeda-beda di setiap negara, jadi periksa hukum di negara "
"Anda. Nama game, sampul, tangkapan layar, dan video adalah milik "
"pemiliknya masing-masing. RetroDB tidak berafiliasi dengan atau didukung "
"oleh produsen konsol, penerbit game, maupun basis data dan layanan game "
"yang digunakannya."

