"When you press Play in DuckStation or PCSX2, RetroDB writes your sign-in "
"to that emulator's own settings file. A sign-in you made in the "
"emulator's own menu is left alone."
msgstr ""
"Saat Anda menekan Main di DuckStation atau PCSX2, RetroDB menulis info "
"masuk Anda ke file pengaturan emulator itu. Info masuk yang Anda buat di "
"menu emulator itu sendiri tidak diubah."

