"First sign in to PlayStation in this browser. Then open the account page:"
" it shows your NPSSO token as JSON. If you are not signed in, it shows "
"\"Invalid login\" instead."
msgstr ""
"Masuk dulu ke PlayStation di browser ini. Lalu buka halaman akun: halaman"
" itu menampilkan token NPSSO Anda sebagai JSON. Jika Anda belum masuk, "
"yang muncul adalah \"Invalid login\"."

