msgid ""
"Replacing a token that still works? Sign out of PlayStation first, then "
"sign in again. Signing out ends the old token, so Sony gives you a new "
"one."
msgstr ""
"Mengganti token yang masih berfungsi? Keluar dari PlayStation dulu, lalu "
"masuk lagi. Saat keluar, token lama dihentikan, sehingga Sony memberi "
"Anda token baru."

